Package: babysteps2git
Title: Baby Steps Toward Version Control from R
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("babysteps2git", "authors", email = "maintainer@example.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A tiny example package used to bootstrap and validate a Cloud
    Agent development environment for R package development. It provides a
    couple of small helper functions together with unit tests so that the
    full lint, document, test, and R CMD check workflow can be exercised end
    to end.
